From 0f6f673b2be7430735ce18986b046808d129ff0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stella Reine <stella@styna.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:03:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] pdh: Implement processor and GPU counters with raw
 counter arrays.

Report real processor utilization from NtQuerySystemInformation for
\Processor(_Total) and \Processor Information(_Total), and add the
\GPU Engine(*) and \GPU Adapter Memory(*) wildcard counters backed by
D3DKMTQueryStatistics. Implement PdhGetRawCounterArray,
PdhGetFormattedCounterArray and PdhFormatFromRawValue with type-aware
calculation of the counter values.

FiveM's performance overlay reads these and showed 0% CPU and GPU.
